Experiments To observe the impact of using out-of-domain (news) data for pretraining to compensate for low resource in-domain (reflection) data, we train 3 variants of PG-net: model training on CNN/DM;

model training on reflections; and model training on CNN/DM then tuning using reflections. Table TABREF11 shows example summaries generated by the three variants of PG-net for a CS document.

For all experiments where reflections are used for training/tuning, we train using a leave one course out

